{
  "id": 258382651,
  "iid": 12719,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "HTTP: Append the status code description if the Reason-Phrase field is missing",
  "description": "Since the tomcat-8.5, the Reason-Phrase will not send in HTTP response (referring to discussion in https://bz.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=60362).\n\nBefore tomcat-8.5, the HTTP response reason-phrase following the status code sent in packet like:\n\n![tomcat8_return_reason_phase](/uploads/081e112d9c91a8dfc5e198fe6dcac7d3/tomcat8_return_reason_phase.png)\n\nAnd please also refer to the tomcat8.5 capture file [tomcat8_return_reason_phase.pcapng](/uploads/d1df8e96857bd5458bab91f2cd1b0cb9/tomcat8_return_reason_phase.pcapng).\n\nBut after tomcat-8.5, the HTTP response reason-phrase will not return like:\n\n![missing_reason_phrase](/uploads/9da5ed46821e125ab53f2f591384bc75/missing_reason_phrase.png)\n\nPlease refer to the tomcat9 capture file [tomcat9_do_not_return_reason_phase.pcapng](/uploads/3cd0b239f90187cf86adb4b006c0c299/tomcat9_do_not_return_reason_phase.pcapng).\n\nThis MR will automatically append the status code description (that actually is standard reason phrase) within left and right parentheses to info column and packet details panel if the reason-phrase is missing in packet:\n\n![auto_complete_reason_phrase](/uploads/11d80eb83c5fa1cb49ad7e58f02bb91b/auto_complete_reason_phrase.png)",
  "state": "opened",
