          "id": 1619542715,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This should be implemented differently. The items as they are currently implemented in the packet details pane are supposed to represent exactly what's in the packet (hence the \\\\r\\\\n at the end). Any additional interpretation, if needed, should be added in a subtree below it. This may even be considered 'generated', hence be marked as such for applicable representation. As for the Info column, this may stand as there's no defined format in there.",
